  "description": "OWUYIQ crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group I 4/m. Reported CIF formula moiety: C120 H100 Fe4 Ho4 N16 O25 Zn4. From the CIF bond table, Ho1 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Zn1 (Zn) has 3 O neighbors; Fe1 (Fe) has 0 O neighbors; Ho2 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Zn2 (Zn) has 3 O neighbors; Fe2 (Fe) has 0 O neighbors; Ho3 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Zn3 (Zn) has 3 O neighbors; Fe3 (Fe) has 0 O neighbors; Ho4 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Zn4 (Zn) has 3 O neighbors; Fe4 (Fe) has 0 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 5 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.385-4.901 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 90.00-180.00°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C120H100Fe4Ho4N16O25Zn4.",
